# Ignore file for dockerfile.dev, whose build context is the parent directory
# holding oblibs/, 66/ and 66-tools/. Keep only those three source trees, minus
# their build outputs, VCS and editor state. Patterns are relative to the context.
*
!oblibs
!66
!66-tools
**/.git
**/.vscode
**/builddir*
**/buildvm*
**/.vmdrop
**/doc/mkdocs/docs
